					<h3 class="font-bold">Discord</h3>
				</div>
				<p class="text-base-content/60 text-sm">Get help, share prints, and chat with the community.</p>
			</a>
			<a href="https://github.com/DragonRailway" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/10 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="text-primary"><path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/></svg>
					<h3 class="font-bold">GitHub</h3>
				</div>
				<p class="text-base-content/60 text-sm">10 repos, open source tracks, firmware, and models.</p>
			</a>
			<a href="https://www.printables.com/@rambros/collections/406299" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-primary/10 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-primary"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
					<h3 class="font-bold">Printables</h3>
				</div>
				<p class="text-base-content/60 text-sm">65+ models including community remixes and contributions.</p>
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 px-4">
	<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
		<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Support the Project</h2>
		<p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed mb-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
			If you find this project interesting, <strong>please share it with your friends</strong> and anyone who might like it. The sustainability of Dragon Railway relies on <strong>community engagement</strong> — more people means more ideas, feedback, and resources.
		</p>
		<p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
			A thriving community ensures we can keep delivering new models, updates, and enhancements — making Dragon Railway a lasting resource for model train makers around the globe.
		</p>
		<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
			<a href="https://www.printables.com/@rambros/collections/406299" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Browse Collection</a>
			<a href="https://github.com/DragonRailway" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">GitHub</a>
			<a href="https://discord.com/invite/3CKbCmZ72G" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">
