				Discord
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 px-4">
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
		<div class="text-center mb-12">
			<p class="text-primary font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-sm mb-3">What People Say</p>
			<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Testimonials</h2>
		</div>

		<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 mb-6">
			<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="text-primary/30 mb-4"><path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/></svg>
			<p class="text-xl md:text-2xl leading-relaxed mb-6">
				"I thought I had <span class="text-primary font-semibold">arrived in heaven</span> when I first saw your Open Source GP7. Thank you for all your fantastic work!"
			</p>
			<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
				<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary font-bold" style="font-family: 'Belanosima', sans-serif;">R</div>
				<span class="font-semibold">Richard</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6">
			<div class="bg-base-200 rounded-xl p-6">
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="text-primary/30 mb-3"><path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/></svg>
				<p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed mb-4">
					"Thank you, for the <span class="text-primary font-semibold">Kid in me</span>. (62 years young.)"
				</p>
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
					<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary font-bold text-sm" style="font-family: 'Belanosima', sans-serif;">P</div>
					<span class="font-semibold text-sm">Pierre</span>
				</div>
